:: Bike
<<effects>>

You climb onto your bike.
<br><br>

Residential
<br>

<<domusicon>><<link [[Ride your bike to Domus Street (Home)|Bike Ride]]>><<set $bikeDestination to "domus">><<set $bikeEndCategory to "left">><</link>>
<br>

